        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/c57346/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-04T19:38:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a villian said something like \"deal 5 damage to the highest HP hero and 3 to the lowest HP hero\" would my following reasoning hold?</p><p>1) all simultaneous actions occur in an order determined by the players and trigger one effect at a time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bunker is at 30 life and all others are at 29. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Could the players choose to Deal bunker 5 damage, thus turning him into the lowest HP hero to give him the other 3? &nbsp;Or are the targets choosen in advance?</p>",
